	(text "1 For a charge current of 500ma to battery\nISET - Charge Current = 500 mA\nRISET = KISET / ICHG = 890 / 0.5 = 1780 Ω = 1.8 kΩ standard value\n\n2 Max input current to IC (to prevent excess heat at the HLK-5m05)\nILIM - Input Current Cap = 600 mA\nRILIM = KILIM / IIN-MAX = 1610 / 0.6 = 2683 Ω = 2.7 kΩ standard value\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.352 63.754 0)
		(effects
