	(text "Using a 174 kΩ/100 kΩ divider with a 1 MΩ feedback resistor,\nI implemented hysteresis in the comparator. This shifts the effective\nthreshold so the circuit turns OFF at ~3.4 V and only turns ON again \nat ~3.6 V, ensuring clean, stable behavior without oscillation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 174.752 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial Black")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
